cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use InterestSeed in research or a product, cite this repository."
title: "InterestSeed: a local-first interest graph and evidence-backed discovery workspace for Obsidian"
abstract: >-
  InterestSeed turns Markdown notes into a confirmable, traceable interest
  graph. It combines a custom Canvas graph, discovery feedback semantics,
  human-in-the-loop application, local-first insights and an optional DSH
  Agent workspace over the Agent Client Protocol.
authors:
  - name: "InterestSeed"
    affiliation: "InterestSeed project"
repository-code: "https://github.com/InterestSeed/interestseed"
license: "AGPL-3.0-only"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
keywords:
  - obsidian
  - knowledge-graph
  - local-first
  - discovery
  - agent-client-protocol
  - deepseek-harness
